{"overview":"Agnes Ayres was apparently a star of feature film who is top billed in this one-off Hal Roach short. She does well as the woman at the centre of the story, but it's pretty plain that it's actually the comic mind and performing talents of Stan Laurel, who plays her butler, that make this two-reel short shine.","cast":[{"n":"Agnes Ayres","c":"The wife","p":"/mQObJxwBA3epElaMwpDsXCvaQeH.jpg","q":"Q255682"},{"n":"Forrest Stanley","c":"Adam, her husband","p":"/3OUSDzqlX2Hqz2hRxwXbrTwObNK.jpg","q":"Q375092"},{"n":"Stan Laurel","c":"Anatole, the butler","p":"/eT15ERUT5T3CVyf2a9JD1VAzC6q.jpg","q":"Q72869"},{"n":"Jerry Mandy","c":"Mr. X / Sir Oliver Hardy","p":"/3DrwSCauQa24p4fVGfhvww8KsUq.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Charlie Hall","c":"Cab driver (uncredited)","p":"/huLPhEhh8pO9v0gSJb7HVB76GRZ.jpg","q":"Q636496"},{"n":"Fred Malatesta","c":"Mr. X's Accomplice (uncredited)","p":"/jLwBxc5dLtk1ynq2bcnUbgRFwG0.jpg","q":"Q5495851"}],"country":["United States"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eve%27s_Love_Letters","qid":"Q3020304","rel":{"US":{"d":"1927-05-28"}},"stills":["eves-love-letters_1927_1.webp","eves-love-letters_1927_2.webp","eves-love-letters_1927_3.webp","eves-love-letters_1927_4.webp"]}